hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"302","[AI-translation] Haddasana Al-Qasim bin Dinar Al-Kufi, qala: Haddasana Ubaidullah bin Musa, wa Talq bin Ghannam, 'an Shaiban, 'an Asim, 'an Zir bin Hubaish, 'an Abdullah, qala: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam har mahine ki shuruwat mein se teen din ke roze rakhte the, aur kam hi jum'ah ke din roza kholte the."
"303","[AI-translation] Haddasana Mahmood bin Ghailan, qala: Haddasana Abu Dawood, qala: Haddasana Shu'bah, 'an Yazeed Ar-Rishk, qala: Sun'tu Mu'adhah, qaalat: Maine 'Aishah se poocha: Kya Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam har mahine mein teen din ka roza rakhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Maine kaha: Mahine ke kin din mein rakhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Unhein iski parwah nahi thi ke kin din se roza rakhein."
"304","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu Hafs Amr bin Ali, qala: Haddasana Abdullah bin Dawood, 'an Sawr bin Yazeed, 'an Khalid bin Ma'dan, 'an Rabee'ah Al-Jurashi, 'an 'Aishah, qaalat: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam peer aur jum'ah ke roze ka ehtimam karte the."
"305","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu Mus'ab Al-Madani, 'an Malik bin Anas, 'an Abi An-Nadr, 'an Abi Salamah bin Abdur-Rahman, 'an 'Aishah, qaalat: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam kisi mahine mein sha'ban ke rozon se zyada roza nahi rakhte the."
"306","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya, qala: Haddasana Abu 'Aasim, 'an Muhammad bin Rifa'ah, 'an Suhail bin Abi Sali'h, 'an abihi, 'an Abi Hurairah, anna An-Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam qala: A'maal peer aur jum'ah ke din pesh kiye jate hain, pas main chahta hoon ke mera 'amal pesh kiya jaye aur main rozedar hoon."
"307","[AI-translation] Haddasana Mahmood bin Ghailan, qala: Haddasana Abu Ahmad, wa Mu'awiyah bin Hisham, qala: Haddasana Sufyan, 'an Mansoor, 'an Khaithamah, 'an 'Aishah, qaalat: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ek mahine mein sanichar, itwaar aur peer ka roza rakhte the, aur doosre mahine mein mangal, budh aur jum'ah ka roza rakhte the."
"308","[AI-translation] Haddasana Haroon bin Ishaq Al-Hamdani, qala: Haddasana 'Abdah bin Sulaiman, 'an Hisham bin 'Urwah, 'an abihi, 'an 'Aishah, qaalat: 'Ashoorah aisa din tha jise Quraish jahiliyat mein roza rakhte the, aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam bhi uska roza rakhte the, phir jab aap Madineen tashreef laye toh aapne uska roza rakha aur uske roze ka hukm diya. Phir jab ramazan farz kiya gaya toh ramazan hi farz ho gaya aur 'Ashoorah chod diya gaya, pas jis ka man kare woh uska roza rakhe aur jis ka man kare woh chod de."
"309","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashaar, qala: Haddasana Abdur-Rahman bin Mahdi, qala: Haddasana Sufyan, 'an Mansoor, 'an Ibrahim, 'an 'Alqamah, qala: Maine 'Aishah se poocha: Kya Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ayyam mein se kisi din ko khaas makhsus karte the? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ka 'amal lagaataar tha, aur tum mein se kaun taqat rakhta hai us 'amal ki jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam karte the."
